2026-10-20T07:47:15.3662692Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3666654Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3667684Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3668137Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3668602Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3669004Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3669376Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3700683Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3703582Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3708061Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3710785Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3729736Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3731570Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T07:47:15.3742430Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
